{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/extras/85d2e207e122ab479575dfab072b32d0.avif?t=1750987003\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>no signal</i> is an emotional point-and-click hard sci-fi adventure game with a free camera. Explore an abandoned station as you aim to uncover the secrets left by the crew and the marks they left upon the station. Piece together an emotional, introspective story about loneliness and meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/extras/b26171626423593cf47a90f920c7fbba.poster.webp?t=1750987003\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/extras/b26171626423593cf47a90f920c7fbba.webp?t=1750987003\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Operate PGEIST, a remote viewing tool that allows the player to view - and interact - with the full 3d environment where you can examine everything. PGEIST can move through walls and furniture, so you can see things from a different perspective.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/extras/d54c37db173289cb1a053a3300683ece.poster.webp?t=1750987003\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/extras/d54c37db173289cb1a053a3300683ece.webp?t=1750987003\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve increasingly complex puzzles, and put together environmental and narrative clues from dialog to progress within an open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/extras/de13473271d6c61f94618f909d118f88.poster.webp?t=1750987003\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/extras/de13473271d6c61f94618f909d118f88.webp?t=1750987003\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Peer into the lives of the researchers aboard the station by piecing together conversations, logs, and journal entries.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2840590?t=1750987003","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/8089785b7c5b5b491d28b06e1c8f2a7049a16e54/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750987003","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/b7bf494f32dd6978542e1a66543b7507eaa7673b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750987003","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/b7bf494f32dd6978542e1a66543b7507eaa7673b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750987003","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3173720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840590/extras/85d2e207e122ab479575dfab072b32d0.avif?t=1750987003\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>no signal</i> is an emotional point-and-click hard sci-fi adventure game